勢いよく跳ねて 始まる夢は 本気の夢は 踊れや踊れ
Spring up with momentum, the dream that begins, the serious dream, dance and dance!

179
00:17:13,814 --> 00:17:20,214
もっともっと一緒に数えたい 新しい景色 パーッとパーッと晴れやかに
More and more, I want to count together the new scenery, brightly and radiantly,

180
00:17:20,214 --> 00:17:22,334
咲かせましょう 花のように
let's make it bloom like a flower!

181
00:17:22,334 --> 00:17:25,574
これからの君が見たい
I want to see you from now on.

182
00:17:25,894 --> 00:17:30,974
始まる夢は 本日の君は 踊れや踊れ どんな形？
The dream that begins, you today, dance and dance, in what form?

183
00:17:31,094 --> 00:17:35,654
踊れや踊れ どんな形 踊れや踊れ
Dance and dance, in what form, dance and dance!

184
00:17:37,334 --> 00:17:43,794
散らさないで もっともっと一緒に数えたい 新しい景色
Don't scatter it, more and more together, I want to count the new scenery.

185
00:17:46,354 --> 00:17:52,674
色華にほ パーッとパーッと晴れやかに咲かせましょう 花のように
In blooming colors, brightly and radiantly let's make it bloom like a flower!

186
00:17:55,254 --> 00:17:58,774
これからの君が見たい
I want to see you from now on.

187
00:18:00,054 --> 00:18:03,374
色華にほ パーッとパーッと晴れやかに 咲かせる想いは 絶え間なく
In blooming colors, brightly and radiantly, the feelings we make bloom are ceaseless,

188
00:18:03,374 --> 00:18:10,534
だって求め合うのは 始めかさだと つぶやいてみた 乙女心さ
because what we seek out is the start... I murmured with a maiden's heart.

189
00:18:22,154 --> 00:18:25,674
迷ってるだけなら 何も起こらない
If you're just hesitating, nothing will happen.

190
00:18:31,594 --> 00:18:35,514
強気で行くんだと 瞳で見とるかるよ
Going forward strong, I'll watch it in your eyes.

191
00:18:36,434 --> 00:18:41,534
そしたらさ おいで 明日が見かピカと
Then come on, tomorrow will sparkle brightly,

192
00:18:42,614 --> 00:18:47,334
輝く夢の 本当さ 夢の色に
shining dream's, true dream's color,

193
00:18:47,974 --> 00:18:52,354
変わる 歌いや歌え
changing, sing and sing,

194
00:18:53,334 --> 00:19:02,154
浮かえながら ずっとずっと一緒に遊びたい 桜色ハーモニー
floating along, forever and ever I want to play together in cherry blossom harmony.

195
00:19:03,654 --> 00:19:08,554
ちりぬるを さらさらと流れゆく 歌かたの花の香り
Falling petals flowing smoothly, the scent of ephemeral flowers,

196
00:19:08,554 --> 00:19:14,614
いつまでも君といたい ちりぬるを さらさらと流れゆく
I want to be with you forever, falling petals flowing smoothly,

197
