209
00:20:25,857 --> 00:20:27,787
いろはにほ パーッとパーッと 晴れやかに 咲かせましょう 花のように
Irohaniho, let's make them bloom brilliantly like flowers,

210
00:20:27,787 --> 00:20:30,587
桜色ハーモニー
shining bright with a Sakura Harmony!

211
00:20:30,587 --> 00:20:34,537
咲かせたい想いはつねならむ
The feelings we want to make bloom are overflowing—

212
00:20:34,537 --> 00:20:37,787
だって乙女道は風まかせと... つぶやいてみた ...乙女心さ!
or so maidenly pride whispers to itself, orphaning the maiden's heart!

213
00:20:40,797 --> 00:20:43,797
迷っているだけなら何も起こらない
If you're just hesitating, nothing will happen.

214
00:20:43,797 --> 00:20:46,887
強気で行くんだと瞳で語るよ
Speak with your eyes that you'll move forward bravely,

215
00:20:46,887 --> 00:20:52,447
そうしたら「さあ、おいで!」
and then— "Come on, lead the way!"

216
00:20:52,447 --> 00:20:55,787
明日がぴかぴかと輝く夢の(本当さ)夢の色に変わる
Tomorrow turns the color of a dream that shines brightly.

217
00:20:55,787 --> 00:20:58,247
歌エヤ歌エ 浮カネナガラ
Sing and dance, let our spirits float away!

218
00:20:58,247 --> 00:21:02,167
ずっとずっと一緒に遊びたい
I want to keep playing together with you forever.

219
